          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting a container discards changes made to files inside it and cannot be undone. Volumes are not deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コンテナを削除すると、コンテナ内のファイルへの変更は失われ、元に戻せません。ボリュームは削除されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect the container “%@” from the network “%@”?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Disconnect the container “%1$@” from the network “%2$@”?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コンテナ「%1$@」をネットワーク「%2$@」から切断しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Docker is unavailable, so the deletion was not performed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker が利用できない状態のため、削除を実行しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Docker is unavailable, so the disconnection was not performed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker が利用できない状態のため、切断を実行しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名前を入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a network name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ネットワーク名を入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a number of 1 or more (GiB) for memory." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メモリは 1 以上の数値（GiB）で入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a whole number of 1 or more (GiB) for the disk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスクは 1 以上の整数（GiB）で入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a whole number of 1 or more for CPU." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU は 1 以上の整数で入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an absolute path." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "絶対パスを入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the subnet as 172.28.0.0/16 (IPv4, prefix length 0-32) or fd00::/64 (IPv6, 0-128)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サブネットは 172.28.0.0/16（IPv4、プレフィックス長 0〜32）か fd00::/64（IPv6、0〜128）の形式で入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything inside the machine is lost when it is deleted. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マシンを削除すると、マシン内のものはすべて失われます。元に戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory can be at most %lld GiB on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この Mac ではメモリは最大 %lld GiB までです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Named volumes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名前付きボリューム"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Named volumes are deleted too. (`docker volume prune` deletes only anonymous volumes by default, but this app includes named volumes.) Data in the volumes is lost and cannot be recovered. The estimated recoverable space is %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名前付きボリュームも削除します（docker volume prune は既定では匿名ボリュームだけを削除しますが、このアプリは名前付きも対象にします）。ボリューム内のデータは失われ、元に戻せません。回復できる容量の推定は %@ です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Networks that no running container is connected to are deleted. Networks referenced only by stopped containers are deleted too, and those containers may fail to start next time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "実行中のコンテナが接続していないネットワークを削除します。停止中のコンテナだけが参照するネットワークも削除され、そのコンテナは次の起動に失敗することがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not observed yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まだ観測していません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再起動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart the VM?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VM を再起動しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the machine “%@”?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マシン「%@」を起動しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting this machine brings the memory allocated to running VMs to %@. That is above %@, 75%% of this Mac’s %@. Other apps and containers may slow down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starting this machine brings the memory allocated to running VMs to %1$@. That is above %2$@, 75%% of this Mac’s %3$@. Other apps and containers may slow down."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このマシンを起動すると、稼働中の VM に割り当てるメモリが合計 %1$@ になります。この Mac の %3$@ の 75%% にあたる %2$@ を超えるため、ほかのアプリやコンテナの動作が遅くなる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Statistics are not being collected because the container is not running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コンテナが実行中ではないため、統計を取得していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop the VM?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VM を停止しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping the VM also stops all running containers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VM を停止すると、稼働中のコンテナもすべて停止します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Docker engine did not respond." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker エンジンから応答がありませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VM is stopped and then started again. All running containers are stopped first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VM を停止してから起動し直します。稼働中のコンテナはいったんすべて停止します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VM type state file was not found." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VM タイプの状態ファイルが見つかりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection was lost. Check the list to see whether the operation completed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接続が途中で切れました。操作が完了したかどうかは一覧で確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The container was not deleted because it is running. Stop it first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コンテナが実行中のため削除しませんでした。先に停止してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk can be at most %lld GiB on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この Mac ではディスクは最大 %lld GiB までです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk can only be expanded. It cannot be smaller than the current %lld GiB." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスクは拡大だけできます。現在の %lld GiB より小さくはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk cannot be smaller than the current %lld GiB. To shrink it, recreate the VM." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスクは現在の %lld GiB より小さくできません。縮小するには VM を作り直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The format of %@ in the settings file is not as expected: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The format of %1$@ in the settings file is not as expected: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ファイルの %1$@ の書式が想定と異なります: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image itself is deleted and this cannot be undone. An image in use by a container cannot be deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "イメージ本体を削除します。元に戻せません。コンテナが使用中のイメージは削除できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine’s state changed, so the deletion was not performed. Choose Delete again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マシンの状態が変わったため、削除を実行しませんでした。もう一度「削除」を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine’s state changed, so the start was not performed. Choose Start again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マシンの状態が変わったため、起動を実行しませんでした。もう一度「起動」を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name can be at most %lld characters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名前は %lld 文字までです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network is deleted. A network with connected containers cannot be deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ネットワークを削除します。コンテナが接続しているネットワークは削除できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The operation was interrupted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作が中断されました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The path cannot contain \"{{\"." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パスに「{{」は使えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The settings file has %lld `%@:` lines at the start of a line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The settings file has %1$lld `%2$@:` lines at the start of a line."
