        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ファイルの行頭に `%2$@:` の行が %1$lld 行あります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The settings file has no `%@:` line at the start of a line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ファイルの行頭に `%@:` の行がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no plain value on the same line as `%@:`." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "`%@:` と同じ行に単純な値がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This container is busy with another operation, so the action was not performed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このコンテナは操作中のため、実行しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This container is running another operation, so the deletion was not performed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このコンテナは別の操作を実行中のため、削除を実行しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This container is running another operation, so the disconnection was not performed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このコンテナは別の操作を実行中のため、切断を実行しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder does not exist." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このフォルダは存在しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder overlaps another shared folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このフォルダは別の共有フォルダと重なっています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This machine is running. It is force-stopped before it is deleted, and everything inside it is lost. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このマシンは稼働中です。削除する前に強制停止し、マシン内のものはすべて失われます。元に戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This name is reserved for the default VM." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この名前は既定の VM 用に予約されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This network is already being deleted, so the deletion was not performed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このネットワークは削除中のため、削除を実行しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tag is deleted. If no other tags remain, the image itself is deleted too and this cannot be undone. An image in use by a container cannot be deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
